{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FSCamera 是一款主打全螢幕構圖的拍攝工具，支援照片與影片，並可在相容裝置上同時以前後鏡頭捕捉眼前景物與自己的反應。它提供即時濾鏡、美顏與影像增強、對焦及曝光控制，以及可選音訊與多種解像度。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合喜歡自拍、記錄反應或創作雙畫面內容的 iPhone 與 iPad 用戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-65.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>雙鏡同步與即時濾鏡</h2>\n<p>在全螢幕介面拍攝照片與影片，可切換模式、設定倒數及變焦。相容裝置支援前後鏡頭同步拍攝，可分別儲存、合併畫面或選用子母畫面，合併畫面按方向並排或堆疊。內置彩色、黑白、復古與像素藝術濾鏡，兩個鏡頭可套用不同效果；另備美顏、影像增強、對焦測光及鎖定，影片可選音訊與 4K 解像度。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-83-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-84-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-85-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-86-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-87-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FSCamera – Full Screen Camera</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fscamera-full-screen-camera/id1558604226?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:17.685821+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:41:27.263570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:45.388051+00:00","content_hash":"d0c682c01752928d8cf685a75a25ad8a0bd2d9688083b0f9c802e5e719019c8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}